title: "DeepSurvey: Deep Multi-Agent Literature Synthesis"
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "DeepSurvey Contributors"
url: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/deepsurvey"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/deepsurvey"
abstract: >-
  An academic-oriented multi-agent system for automated literature review,
  knowledge graph construction, and research gap analysis. DeepSurvey
  orchestrates five specialized AI agents that collaborate through long-chain
  reasoning to transform research papers into structured synthesis reports.
